{
  "_comment": [
    "Boss routing map. One entry per Phase 1 intent, in tie-break order (an earlier intent wins a tied prompt score).",
    "members: preferred agents/skills, highest first. A bare name also matches a plugin item of that name (security-reviewer -> oh-my-claudecode:security-reviewer). Members that are not installed are skipped.",
    "advisor: true marks Advisor Group members; route hints tag them [advisor].",
    "description_keywords: an installed agent/skill whose name or description contains one of these becomes a candidate after the members.",
    "prompt_keywords: case-insensitive; a user prompt scores one point per matched keyword and the top-scoring intent (score >= 1) gets a route hint. Latin keywords match at a word start; Korean keywords match anywhere.",
    "adoption_ignore: process skills whose use says nothing about advice quality; the adoption tracker never records them as offers. An entry also matches a plugin-qualified id with that short name (cancel -> oh-my-claudecode:cancel)."
  ],
